        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the example of cross signing shown in Figure H.10, there are 2 separate vehicle sub-CA2 certificates; one is signed by the OEM root CA certificate while the other is signed by the V2G root CA certificate. Both of them have the same exact public/private key pair.",
