        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As mentioned earlier, the certificate structures depicted here are simply examples. All entities are allowed to choose any structure that works for their implementations. Any certificate structure chosen by the various entities should abide by the constraints set up by this document. For example, a CPS certificate is not allowed to be signed by the OEM root CA certificate.",
